# Swift Package Manager. `flutter build` generates the FlutterFramework package and
# the plugin package symlinks under Flutter/ephemeral/, all containing absolute local
# paths. Package.resolved is deliberately NOT ignored here: this is an application, so
# its resolved dependency versions should be committed and reproducible. (The plugin
# package itself does ignore it — a library must not pin its dependents.)
Flutter/ephemeral/
**/.swiftpm/

